  "content": "There is no attendance on record for any of the 8 players, and no goal is active right now. That is an empty read, not a failed one. I checked it two ways and both came back empty. Either attendance hasn't been checked in on the calendar events, or it hasn't been recorded for this team.\n\n**Goals:** The 5 goals on file are all closed, and they belong to two players, Cole Bennett and Owen Carter. The other 6 players have none visible. Goals a player keeps private don't show here.\n\n- **Cole, wedge distance control:** Achieved. Average proximity went from 28 ft to 15.29 ft against an 18 ft target.\n- **Cole, short putting from 3 to 5 ft:** Missed. His make rate was 46.5% against a 92% target, from a baseline of 82%.\n- **Owen, approach proximity:** Missed, but close. Proximity went from 24 ft to 15.95 ft against a 15 ft target, which is 89% of the way.\n- **Owen, 5 to 10 ft make rate:** Missed. His make rate was 34.5% against a 75% target, from a baseline of 58%.\n- **Owen, scrambling from the rough:** Missed. No current value was recorded, so I can't say how far he got.\n\nAll five ended in July, so none of them says where these players stand now. The putting goals ended well below their baselines.\n\nSeparately, Audit Testplayer has no recorded rounds, so there is no performance data for that player either.\n\nIf you want, I can draft new goals for the players who have none, or read the current putting numbers for Cole and Owen first.",
